("p", "The general-sustainability corpus — Round 32 of the arena: five core papers, the four-paper wave E, a five-layer successor manuscript, six computational notes, and the ECOMOD study from the second agent — is the programme at planetary scale, and it names itself accordingly: its second paper is an obstruction calculus. The objects are assessment systems, material ledgers, delay dynamics, sampled governance, and forecast ladders with interventions; the notes supply computational certification, worked systems, exact belief computation, and probabilistic sufficiency — the certificate discipline transposed from solvers to institutions. What the governance corpus adds that the mathematics cannot is stakes and asymmetry: a mis-sampled governance grid is not a theorem failing, it is a policy succeeding on the wrong quotient, with the error surfacing a decade later in the ledger."),
("p", "Each paper runs the trichotomy at institutional scale. Assessment separation (v62) separates prediction from prescription — the realizability of policy under assessment resolution, with the two failure modes priced separately. The obstruction calculus (v55) and its notes certify when institutional constraints cannot be jointly satisfied and what relaxation would cost. Material ledgers (v32) treat accounting as a quotient on physical flows, with identifiability conditions for what the books can and cannot see. Delay dynamics (v41) is guarded feedback in institutional time. Sampled governance (v47) is literally sensor design for institutions — what must be monitored, how often, at what resolution, for a target to remain attainable. Wave E’s cod and Edwards forecast ladders (v59, v16) and their interventions (v23, v15) are refinement ladders carrying monotone certified forecasts — the inner/outer sandwich at the scale of fisheries and planetary boundaries — while the minimax dual-certificates note supplies the duality face, and ECOMOD (v37) shows how aggregation conceals composition: biocapacity drawdown is unidentifiable from aggregated accounts, the resolution-limited quotient made fiscal."),
("p", "Read together with the rest of the corpus, the governance works are the programme’s demonstration that its refusals scale. The same three questions — can this institution’s policy factor through what it monitors; what does finer monitoring cost; what certificate witnesses the answer — that organize a two-node driving puzzle organize a planetary accounting system, and the answer the corpus gives at both scales is the same: certify the obstruction, price the repair, and refuse unwitnessed optimism."),
