("p", "For a reader entering the corpus with this picture in hand, the reading order that follows the architecture rather than the chronology is: Effective Causal Descent, Volume 1, then Volume 2; the unified transduction manuscript (v9); the combs submission with the two currying papers; the channel and instrument papers; the monitored-circuits manuscript with its supplement; the metabolic pair; the sustainability compendium of Round 32; and the chess paper — with the master file, “top-down of my work.txt”, as the prism through which the whole is meant to refract."),
("p", "Read whole, the corpus is a single instrument played across eight registers, and its coherence is architectural rather than thematic: one primitive, two currencies, three faces, two walls, one compositional home, one epistemology. What the union asserts that no single volume does is exactly what opus 5 said, now confirmed across every line of the corpus: contextuality, finite-state approximation, and treewidth-bounded synthesis are one subject — bounded-interface factorization; Farkas, Nehari, Čech, and dynamic-programming refutation certificates are one duality, instantiated four ways; every “no” is proof-relevant; hardness comes in exactly two flavours, complementary rather than competing; and presentation-relativity plus monotone refinement is a sufficient epistemology for certified reasoning about partially observed physical systems. That is the grand picture. The works are its witnesses."),
